|url=https://1819news.com/news/item/tuberville-on-suspected-brown-university-shooter-the-islamic-death-cult-is-incompatible-with-america
|access-date=December 15, 2025|website=1819 News|language=en}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news|last=Choi|first=Matthew|date=December 15, 2025|title=Some Republican lawmakers call for mass expulsion of American Muslims|url=https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2025/12/15/republicans-muslim-mass-expulsions/|access-date=December 15, 2025|newspaper=Washington Post|language=en|archive-date=December 16, 2025|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20251216040309/https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2025/12/15/republicans-muslim-mass-expulsions/|url-status=live}}</ref>

